193063588175.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">275</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">29</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff\">利用上世代死之律者核心制成的执掌凋零的神之键。那吞噬万物的黑，将分解一切被其刺穿的事物。</span></p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">湮灭圣裁</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:25秒]发动一次突刺攻击，造成50%攻击力物理伤害。如果击中非无敌/霸体状态的敌人，则发动投技攻击，控制敌人并造成共90%+1,200.0%攻击力物理伤害；在敌人特定招式期间，武器按钮闪光时，可无视所有条件发动反击投技，控制敌人并造成20%+700.0%攻击力物理伤害，不计入冷却时间；被投技命中的敌人受到物理伤害提升10.0%，持续5秒。</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">败殁无生</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff\">角色全伤害提升15.0%，自身攻击脆弱状态下的敌人时，暴击率额外提升15.0%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">创生之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff\">在联机Raid关卡中，角色的武器技能、分支攻击、蓄力攻击和必杀技的全伤害提升22.0%，角色使用武器主动技能后，每次造成伤害时回复1.5%最大生命值，持续6秒（该效果有1秒触发间隔）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">装备锻造</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">幽晦的灰晶*250</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">空间透镜*200</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">以太燃素*1200</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A2%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A8%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2245%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%